+Two kinds of ADR exist today:
+- **Garura's own ADRs** — 31 Markdown files in `docs/adr/`, written by hand. Only 17 carry a
+  `**Status:**` line; 8 say "Supersedes", 3 say "Amends". The format has drifted.
